 based in Mumbai, India.","employees":198,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":1788220800,"asOf":1795440732},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795440732,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Oriental Rail Infrastructure\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Oriental Rail Infrastructure Ltd Upgraded to Hold on Improved Technicals and Financials","s":"MarketsMojo","d":1794719603,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Oriental Rail Infrastructure Wins ₹2.18 Crore Order from South Western Railway","s":"EquityBulls","d":1794649910,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOdm9VYW9CeVZXS0xsc3h2LW5JRlV3aTB4ZlZqTlJ5RkZGaXUxWUotSnhjU1ZYVmZqaXJWaUlXaUlEOE1zVndLWmFyTXlrejFfYzY1RnlxSklPWEZVMFl2Nkd1d0NwOU11dkUyaExhYm9seTB0MTV3S2FiMlM4MUNJV2FMaWpkUWt3NkxEV3dBQVgwOW8yNlV1d3FjbzdWSUVYVzl2Q2wtaWVRbTJIZ2lqOU1maHE5VlA3?oc=5","g":["ord"]},{"t":"Oriental Rail Infrastructure JV bags ₹44.19 crore contract to refurbish 75 LHB coaches","s":"ET Infra","d":1794211200,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":["ord"]},{"t":"Oriental Rail's JV Bags ₹44 Crore Order to Refurbish 75 LHB Coaches for Central Railway","s":"Trade Brains","d":1794206902,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPeVlGLUpMbXUzRXhFVlJPTnZ5Y01LUEFveEZVVkhTNjRWc2laVnVscXdPWEJEWDZTcXo2eDg1Qlgza2RFSU5WT3E0alZZak05eXdPNVZhcXN0N0x6UkJ1ZXJBU3hEU0ZFU1dwN3F3a3hRaWMtVnRBdTJQNGRrRmRXa05SQkJ0emw2Z0pRU0tDYWl4WGdDcGxqN2ZUWHNlbW0zM05BMVJ6Y1gtZXV6TGJjZFlySzctUnRrMXNFbzhZTkJpT0RfZlBsYkFjUzM?oc=5","g":["ord"]},{"t":"Oriental Rail Infrastructure Limited Gets ₹630.61 Crore Order","s":"Multibagg AI","d":1794124237,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNcW5fU081bzdiVU92Ny1UeEpKOFNfZUdpVGlXOFBYejZMVUZyWDFaVHRyakdhUnY4dWxkTXFVTHRVSFgzRjJzRWJUNTBJVWlnUDV6RkhIalFldFdlX1FUWUtWQ05NUGc4ZmZoQ05JWlpDTmpWcE5ydFY4eGduRmxQdWw2N3d6d1hNbUdQNWNndS1kNG1KY0t3TTNTbnZ5UVY4YVd3Xw?oc=5","g":["ord"]},{"t":"Oriental RI Consolidated September 2026 Net Sales 